# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
# Peripheral drivers users plug into an SM8750 tablet: HID devices (Bluetooth and
# USB mice, keyboards, game controllers, pens), USB serial adapters, USB network
# adapters, printers, USB audio and common removable-media filesystems.
# Generated from the Ubuntu 26.04 generic arm64 kernel configuration (7.0.0-42),
# keeping only these classes and leaving out drivers for hardware a tablet cannot
# have (HID sensor hubs, Hyper-V, laptop SPI touch, USB LCD panels, parallel ports). All of them are modules that
# load only when a matching device appears.
